2026-07-31 13:17:43,365 1251 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': "Extract mt-wake: sleepCycle()'s beacon+RX-window+schedule loop, plus sleepNow()'s anchored\nscheduling math, into device/lib/mt-wake/ as a class with a real interface -- the v2/v3 seam.\nNOT a pure move (introduces structure), acceptance is behavioral on hardware (same beat, same\nwindow, same timing as v2 today), not binary-diff. doSleep() itself stays in main.cpp\n(deliberate -- the camera-UART-float exception already documented in uart-float-before-sleep.md),\ncalled via a passed function pointer at the point sleepNow currently calls it.\n\nScope decision: instead of exposing all ~27 individual dependencies as separate callbacks,\ncollapse them to the natural phase boundaries sleepCycle() already has -- sendBeacon() (one\ncallback, main.cpp keeps the NodeInfo/position/metrics/env/calc bundle + sleepBeats/\ng_announceLeft gating exactly as today) and routePacket() (one callback, main.cpp keeps the\nNodeInfo/command/private-app/chunk dispatch exactly as today). This is the DI pattern every prior\nslice used, scaled to match this function's real complexity rather than exposing every symbol\nindividually."}
