2026-07-31 13:41:34,937 1251 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_step_notes_set args={'number': 4, 'notes_md': 'One clean rak-debug pass, hardware-confirmed: flashed rak/v2, then flipped `sleepMode` on via mesh command and observed a real System-ON sleep/wake cycle over serial. Log output matched the pre-extraction LC/RXWIN/SLEEPNOW format byte-for-byte:\n\n```\nLC radio +0ms agc=1\nLC beacon +Nms\nLC rxopen +Nms win=8000\nRXWIN: from=... id=... port=... rssi=... snr=... t=+Nms\nLC rxdone +Nms rx=1\nLC drain +Nms q=0\nSLEEPNOW woke=... awake=...ms beat=...ms sleep=...ms -> next=...\n```\n\nA packet landed inside the RX window and was routed correctly (RXWIN + dispatch), the anchored-scheduling math (`wokeAt + heartbeatMs`) matched the original sleepCycle()/sleepNow() arithmetic exactly, and the device re-entered sleep and woke again on schedule for a second cycle (confirmed via mesh-gw lastHeard progressing ~295s per cycle). No regressions observed in beacon content, window width, or drain behavior.'}
2026-07-31 13:41:39,067 1251 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_step_notes_set args={'number': 4, 'text': 'One clean rak-debug pass, hardware-confirmed: flashed rak/v2, then flipped `sleepMode` on via mesh command and observed a real System-ON sleep/wake cycle over serial. Log output matched the pre-extraction LC/RXWIN/SLEEPNOW format byte-for-byte:\n\n```\nLC radio +0ms agc=1\nLC beacon +Nms\nLC rxopen +Nms win=8000\nRXWIN: from=... id=... port=... rssi=... snr=... t=+Nms\nLC rxdone +Nms rx=1\nLC drain +Nms q=0\nSLEEPNOW woke=... awake=...ms beat=...ms sleep=...ms -> next=...\n```\n\nA packet landed inside the RX window and was routed correctly (RXWIN + dispatch), the anchored-scheduling math (`wokeAt + heartbeatMs`) matched the original sleepCycle()/sleepNow() arithmetic exactly, and the device re-entered sleep and woke again on schedule for a second cycle (confirmed via mesh-gw lastHeard progressing ~295s per cycle). No regressions observed in beacon content, window width, or drain behavior.'}
